{"name": "RUNE GUNNER", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>RUNE GUNNER is a 1-4 player co-op roguelite shooter where you fuse guns and magic, mix classes mid-run, and break your build in the best way possible.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CO-OP CHAOS, BUILT RUN BY RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends in fast, chaotic runs where <strong>every choice reshapes your build</strong>. Stack abilities, adapt on the fly, and turn one good run into something unrecognizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/0218bba6bd1a1064f2b87ced6b15540b.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/0218bba6bd1a1064f2b87ced6b15540b.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/0218bba6bd1a1064f2b87ced6b15540b.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MIX CLASSES MID-RUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start with one class and <strong>add more mid-run</strong>. New abilities and passive runes stack together to reshape how you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/1143623d5c7277355b9aa6de4c6a91fb.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/1143623d5c7277355b9aa6de4c6a91fb.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/1143623d5c7277355b9aa6de4c6a91fb.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO FLAT STATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runes change how you play, not just the numbers.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Never reload</strong> and let every shot hit harder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn shields into ammo</strong> and fire endlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Burn one enemy</strong> and detonate the whole room</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/2232f48c540f0900193878ce10bb23ab.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/2232f48c540f0900193878ce10bb23ab.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/2232f48c540f0900193878ce10bb23ab.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>OVERPOWERED RUNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strong runs build momentum quickly. <strong>Stack synergies</strong>, take risks, and push your loadout further with every room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/7d74818dcbf26abdb61b848f0dfb74e8.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/7d74818dcbf26abdb61b848f0dfb74e8.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/7d74818dcbf26abdb61b848f0dfb74e8.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DIVE INTO THE SHROUD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Shroud is a fractured realm overrun by hostile Constructs. To survive, you must wield the same unstable magic that powers them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/02dc493ec42cac828c97fcff90c3b80e.poster.avif?t=1782233684\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/02dc493ec42cac828c97fcff90c3b80e.webm?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/extras/02dc493ec42cac828c97fcff90c3b80e.mp4?t=1782233684\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>SHORT RUNS, BUILT FOR CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short, replayable runs make <strong>experimentation easy</strong>. Procedural rooms and shifting class offerings keep each descent unpredictable. Drop in with friends, coordinate builds, and see how every run evolves differently.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "RUNE GUNNER is a 1-4 player co-op roguelite shooter where you fuse guns and magic, mix classes mid-run, and break your build in the best way possible.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769870/7e6681eb685fc7209a9797a657ec870f54dac162/header.jpg?t=1782233684", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Third-Person Shooter", "Roguelite", "Perma Death", "Shooter", "Action"], "developers": "False Summit", "publishers": "False Summit", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3769870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/i9qrARXdLKw", "first_seen": 1780524000.0, "review_rank": 496}